          "title": "对数化并识别 Taylor 系数",
          "solution_type": "teaching",
          "text": "令 $u=x+f(x)/x$。题设等价于 $\\ln(1+u)/x\\to3$，因而 $u\\to0$ 且 $u/x\\to3$，即 $f(x)/x^2\\to2$。与二阶展开 $f(x)=f(0)+f'(0)x+f''(0)x^2/2+o(x^2)$ 比较，得前三个答案。又 $f(x)/x=2x+o(x)$，所以 $x^{-1}\\ln(1+f(x)/x)\\to2$，末极限为 $e^2$。",
          "main_method_code": "identify_taylor_coefficients_from_limit",
          "is_primary": true,
          "steps": [
