      "title": "右端点 Riemann 和的一阶误差",
      "stem": "设 $f\\in C^1[0,1]$，\n$$\\varepsilon_n=\\int_0^1f(x)dx-\\frac1n\\sum_{k=1}^nf(k/n).$$\n求 $\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}n\\varepsilon_n$。",
      "question_type": "proof",
      "difficulty_level": 4,
      "answers": [
        {
          "answer_type": "symbolic",
          "answer_text": "$\\dfrac{f(0)-f(1)}2$。",
          "is_primary": true
        }
      ],
      "solutions": [
        {
          "title": "逐小区间展开误差",
          "solution_type": "teaching",
          "text": "在 $I_k=[(k-1)/n,k/n]$ 上，$f(x)-f(k/n)=-\\int_x^{k/n}f'(t)dt$。由 $f'$ 一致连续，双重积分一致等于 $-f'(k/n)/(2n^2)+o(n^{-2})$。求和并乘 $n$，得 $n\\varepsilon_n=-\\frac1{2n}\\sum_{k=1}^nf'(k/n)+o(1)$，其 Riemann 和趋于 $-[f(1)-f(0)]/2$。",
          "main_method_code": "cellwise_riemann_sum_expansion",
          "is_primary": true,
          "steps": [
            {
              "order": 1,
              "role": "transform",
              "text": "把总误差拆成每个小区间的右端点误差。"
            },
            {
              "order": 2,
              "role": "apply_method",
              "text": "用 $f'$ 的一致连续性给出每格一致的一阶展开。",
              "method_code": "cellwise_riemann_sum_expansion"
            },
            {
              "order": 3,
              "role": "compute",
              "text": "误差主项化为 $f'$ 的 Riemann 和。"
            },
            {
              "order": 4,
              "role": "conclude",
              "text": "由 $\\int_0^1f'=f(1)-f(0)$ 得答案。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
